# [DMM](../wg/dmm.html)

## Summary
The Distributed Mobility Management (DMM) Working Group met during IETF 127. The session was chaired by Sri Gundavelli, with co-chair Satoru Matsushima participating remotely. The meeting covered updates on active working group drafts—including mobile traffic steering, MUP architecture, SRv6 mobile user plane architecture, YANG models for attachment circuits, and SRH reduction for SRv6 End.M.GTP6.E—as well as an individual proposal on BGP MUP extensions for 6G user planes. Jen Linkova was welcomed as the new Area Director.

## Key Discussion Points

