- **Presentation:** [IETF 127 DMM Working Group chair slides](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-dmm-ietf-127-dmm-working-group-chair-slides-01)
- **Presenter:** Sri Gundavelli
- Sri Gundavelli opened the meeting, presented the Note Well, and reviewed the agenda.
