### Mobile Traffic Steering
- **Presentation:** [Mobile Traffic Steering](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-dmm-mobile-traffic-steering-00)
- **Presenter:** Marco Liebsch
- **Draft:** `draft-ietf-dmm-mts`
- **Discussion:**
